# Normalise text to LF in the repository. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows checks the corpus out with CRLF, and the next `npm run gen-corpus`
# rewrites it with LF — leaving 1100+ files permanently "modified" and burying
# the diff that is supposed to tell you which recipes actually changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Ground truth and vendored data: byte-for-byte, never touched.
*.png       binary
*.gz        binary
corpus/manifest.json    -text
corpus/recipes/*.json   -text

# The reference snapshot is compared against upstream; keep it exactly as copied.
reference/*.ts  -text
